peech, llm, yolo, aruco_marker, face, robot/ooda and robot/virtual, xgo_robot, system_pipelines).  Each package index maps the committed example PipelineDefinition JSON files to the documents covering the elements they exercise, and each document records the usage comments, Interfaces, CLI commands and \"To Do\" lists from the sources, separating implemented behaviour from planned or mocked work-in-progress.  A top-level \"documentation/examples/ReadMe.md\" provides the package table, reading paths and status, noting that the \"hyperspace/\" example is a data-only tree covered by the HyperSpace concept document.  Also add \"Examples guide\" pointers to the Related documentation sections of \"documentation/concepts/ReadMe.md\" and \"documentation/elements/ReadMe.md\".","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"StarRocks/starrocks","commit_timestamp":"2026-07-06T06:10:10Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"d1936221f2bcdeb04a47f2a224d158778cdcea86","github_link":"https://github.com/StarRocks/starrocks/commit/d1936221f2bcdeb04a47f2a224d158778cdcea86","commit_subject":"[Refactor] Remove dead TopN ordering in IVM appendPkLoadOpColumn (#75859)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"israel-dryer/ttkbootstrap","commit_timestamp":"2026-07-06T06:09:54Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"7ef83098983e0674721d58e8e96dab952461b092","github_link":"https://github.com/israel-dryer/ttkbootstrap/commit/7ef83098983e0674721d58e8e96dab952461b092","commit_subject":"Record E2 human visual gate PASSED","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr","commit_timestamp":"2026-07-06T06:09:48Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"79663eeb9103d9e611fdd83634a05e30827aa3cb","github_link":"https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/commit/79663eeb9103d9e611fdd83634a05e30827aa3cb","commit_subject":"Bluetooth: Host: add tx_power field to bt_le_adv_param","ai_tool":"Augment"},{"repo_name":"IfcOpenShell/IfcOpenShell","commit_timestamp":"2026-07-06T06:09:11Z","branch":"v0.9.0","commit_sha":"5e539890f16046309db419